  "prefLabel": "Res 8405.03 Snowmobile Grooming and Snow Removal Grant-In-Aid Program Application",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Res 8405.03 Snowmobile Grooming and Snow Removal Grant-In-Aid Program Application. Snowmobile clubs and political subdivisions applying for grant-in-aid for winter snowmobile projects shall complete, and submit, the Snowmobile Grooming and Snow Removal Grant-In-Aid Program Application Form 8405.03, 2015 Version. Projects shall include winter trail grooming operations and/or parking lot snow removal.\n\nSource. #9350, eff 12-24-08; ss by #10850, eff 6-17-15",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/res8100-8500.html"
